      r: ['Correct. Homans sign misses many clots and gives false positives; ultrasound (often with a D-dimer) is the standard.', 'Incorrect. It is neither sensitive nor specific.', 'Incorrect. Never massage a leg with a suspected clot — it could break loose.', 'Incorrect. Not a diagnostic test.'],
