      r: ['Correct. A low MCV (small-cell) anemia most often means iron deficiency, so iron studies come next.', 'Incorrect. B₁₂ deficiency causes a high MCV.', 'Incorrect. Not the first test for a small-cell anemia in most adults.', 'Incorrect. Lipids do not explain anemia.'],
